    "summary": "Fresh Astra single-pass visual reading of all 24 prepared original pages, including both original English question editions, all six key images, full practical rubric, geographic grid and four year reference sheets. All three Bulgarian whole-problem IDs and 15 parts retained. Official keys and rubric restored natively; culmination, photometry and applicable planetary tables are native text. Earlier English Astra transcripts reused only after fresh source reading and comparison. No separate model checker. Final actual crop inspection is recorded separately.",
    "sourceGaps": [
      "The official key acknowledges that point II is plotted incorrectly. Section 7.2 gives A/B latitudes 36.47°/36.10°, while section 7.4 and the final table give 36.49°/36.11°. Both are retained.",
      "The blank eccentric-orbit plotting sheet (a) is absent from the full year inventory. The supplied geographic grid belongs to Fireball. The official completed orbit diagram is retained in the solution. The key prints an arcsecond mark after the distance 384400, uses Moon diameter 3476.4 km (3476 in its calculation), while the reference sheet lists 3475 km; values are retained. Its culmination difference table is reproduced as printed, including entries that do not equal the adjacent clock-time difference.",
      "Blank graph papers (A) and (B) are absent from the full year inventory. Complete data and completed official plots are retained. The colour-colour heading prints NGC6282; the 8.4 explanation prints NGC2686; the actual problem is NGC2682. The Hyades absolute-magnitude equation and 0.75 answer are retained without recalculation.",
      "No Bulgarian official solution found; full supplied English sketches and rubric retained."
    ],
    "cropInspectionHistory": "Every one of the 8 final actual crops opened and personally visually inspected in this batch after generation with --no-snap. No crop revisions. Complete geographic-grid limits, source trajectory diagrams, Moon orbit, cluster plotting axes and H-R labels retained. The grid occupies the whole original image; its automated large-box warning is expected.",
    "sharedReading": "All 24 prepared original pages were freshly visually read in this batch; no source pages counted solely from an earlier batch. Earlier English Astra transcriptions were reused only after comparison against this source reading. Shared fireball and distinct alpha Moon and beta Clusters source ownership confirmed from original English questions. No separate checker.",
